{"title": "Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb", "pageid": 30372, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp, /w/images/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>, that lets her entomb in web a creature attacking one of her <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spiderling\" title=\"Phase Spiderling\">spiderlings</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round if her offspring is attacked, the Phase Spider Matriarch can spend a Legendary Action to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gossamer_Tomb\" title=\"Gossamer Tomb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gossamer Tomb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gossamer_Tomb\" title=\"Gossamer Tomb\">Gossamer Tomb</a>. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Gossamer_Tomb_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Gossamer Tomb</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Once per round if her offspring is attacked, this creature will try to encase the attacker in a <a href=\"/wiki/Gossamer_Tomb\" title=\"Gossamer Tomb\">Gossamer Tomb</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The Phase Spider Matriarch must be able to see the attacker to trigger this Legendary Action.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Spend a legendary action to trap a <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spiderling\" title=\"Phase Spiderling\">Phase Spiderling</a> attacker in a Gossamer Tomb.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201826\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1057/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9714/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4190/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 169/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643719/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.988      1 -total\n 99.09%   36.653      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 29.08%   10.758      2 Template:Icon_link\n 28.04%   10.370      2 Template:Icon_text\n 26.37%    9.752      1 Template:SAI\n 24.55%    9.082      6 Template:Trim\n 19.56%    7.236      2 Template:Ifempty\n 18.59%    6.877      1 Template:Condition\n 16.15%    5.975      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.79%    3.991      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30372-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201826 and revision id 402614. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}